OL,3,GNEWSAOxford Street spend up since
OL,4,Atraffic ban, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of London has praised early
OL,7,Ffigures showing the "transformational
OL,8,Fimpact" pedestrianisation has had on
OL,9,FOxford Street.
OL,11,FFigures from Adyen payment company show
OL,12,Fspending at Oxford Street stores rose
OL,13,Fby 28% from about #2.9m last year to
OL,14,F#3.7m this year.
OL,16,FData from City Hall and the Oxford
OL,17,FStreet Development Corporation shows
OL,18,Fthat more people visited the area
OL,19,Fduring the first week of
OL,20,Fpedestrianisation and spent more in
OL,21,Fshops than in the equivalent period
OL,22,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
