OL,3,GNEWSAOxford Street spend up since
OL,4,Atraffic ban, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our early work has been very warmly
OL,7,Freceived by Londoners and visitors,
OL,8,Fwith a surge in footfall and spend,"
OL,9,FLord Sadiq Khan said.
